(4, 'Ultimate Trust', 'ultimate-trust', '<p>Since 1985, we have maintained the highest standards of integrity and transparency in every transaction.</p>', 'Since 1985, we have maintained the highest standards of integrity and transparency in every transaction.', 'service-ultimate-trust.png', 'service-ultimate-trust.png', 'Ultimate Trust - Manna Kampus', 'Prodi S1 Akuntansi STIE Widya Wiwaha', 'Manna Kampus has maintained the highest standards of integrity and transparency since 1985.'),
